    /// The MLflow configuration using SageMaker managed MLflow. MlflowResourceArn -&gt; (string) [required] The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the MLflow resource. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 2048 o pattern: arn:aws[a-z\-]*:sage- maker:[a-z0-9\-]*:[0-9]{12}:mlflow-[a-zA-Z-]*/.* MlflowExperimentName -&gt; (string) The MLflow experiment name used for this job. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 256 o pattern: .* MlflowRunName -&gt; (string) The MLflow run name used for this job. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 256 o pattern: .* Shorthand Syntax: MlflowResourceArn=string,MlflowExperimentName=string,MlflowRunName=string JSON Syntax: { "MlflowResourceArn": "string", "MlflowExperimentName": "string", "MlflowRunName": "string" }
    /// </summary>
